{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/TITLE_1.png?t=1744676329\" /><i><strong></strong></i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/codex_gif.gif?t=1744676329\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a quirky adventure with four unique main characters as they seek their truth, battling gods, colossal corporations, and bizarre foes along the way. Unravel the Eternal Eclipse mystery and uncover the world's ancient secrets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>This story contains adult humor and some mature themes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/TITLE_2.png?t=1744676329\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Navigate the world with a platformer-inspired system, allowing you to climb, jump off, and hoist up ledges, breaking free from classic grid-based movement.</strong> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/Platforming.gif?t=1744676329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/TITLE_3.png?t=1744676329\" />- <strong>Engage in combat with active player input during attack animations (timed hits), incorporating dodging and parrying. Special moves feature minigame sequences for extra damage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/Combat.gif?t=1744676329\" /> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039920/extras/TITLE_4.png?t=1744676329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Blending pixel art, with beautiful rendering, taking 